SGLang Model Gateway - Rust-based inference gateway

Usage: sgl-model-gateway [OPTIONS]
       sgl-model-gateway <COMMAND>

Commands:
  launch  Launch the router (same as running without subcommand) [alias: start]
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --version-verbose
          Print detailed version information and exit

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

Server Configuration:
      --host <HOST>
          Host address to bind the router server
          
          [default: 0.0.0.0]

      --port <PORT>
          Port number to bind the router server
          
          [default: 30000]

Request Handling:
      --max-payload-size <MAX_PAYLOAD_SIZE>
          Maximum payload size in bytes
          
          [default: 536870912]

      --cors-allowed-origins [<CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS>...]
          CORS allowed origins

      --request-id-headers [<REQUEST_ID_HEADERS>...]
          Custom HTTP headers to check for request IDs

      --shutdown-grace-period-secs <SHUTDOWN_GRACE_PERIOD_SECS>
          Grace period in seconds to wait for in-flight requests during shutdown
          
